abstract: "Proposed AI-assisted analytic bounds with a separate AI counter-review. No independent human review or formal verification is attested. The bounds are very conservative and uninformative at the radii already studied; R0=2 is a validity threshold, not a practical asymptotic threshold. C51 remains partial and no completely certified mean at R=50 is claimed. Quantitative note v0.1a; DEL 1.1 within the supplied scope."
